  "title": "Qt: extract filePathsMatch() with runtime case-sensitivity detection",
  "description": "Move the string-based path comparison from workspace_state.cpp\ninto qt_ui_utils as filePathsMatch() and use it in profile_switcher\nand profile_model as well.\n\nOn macOS/FreeBSD, the fallback branch (when at least one file does\nnot exist) now queries pathconf(_PC_CASE_SENSITIVE) at runtime\ninstead of assuming case-insensitive.\n\nBuilds on !23630.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Claude)",
