        {
          "id": 3093108248,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Well, I just tried it on Windows, and because it's just comparing the canonicalFilePaths, it is claiming that two files that are the same other than case are different (comparing filePath and filePath.toUpper()).\n\nWhereas, if I replace that line with `fi1 == fi2` it correctly says that those are the same on Windows.",
